div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-578d989 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"578d989\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Types of Ant Species We Control<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c0c2f1e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c0c2f1e\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f6bb8ec elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f6bb8ec\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Ant infestations can be a serious nuisance, causing damage to property and contaminating food sources. Our professional ant control services effectively target various species, ensuring a pest-free environment. Here are the common types of ants we control:<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e9cbe7b elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"e9cbe7b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-741e3ac e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"741e3ac\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-eaf7d4f e-con-full e-transform e-transform e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"eaf7d4f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:10,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-be021bf elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"be021bf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"900\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/argentine-ant-identif-85.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-806\" alt=\"argentine-ant-identif-85\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/argentine-ant-identif-85.jpg 900w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/argentine-ant-identif-85-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/argentine-ant-identif-85-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">1. Argentine Ants<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">Argentine ants are small, light to dark brown ants that form massive colonies. They are known for invading homes in search of food and water, often creating extensive trails. Their rapid reproduction makes them difficult to control without professional treatment.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9cd4270 e-con-full e-transform e-transform e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9cd4270\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:10,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-939910b elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"939910b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"900\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Carpenter-Ants.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-1220\" alt=\"Black carpenter ant on a wooden surface\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Carpenter-Ants.jpg 900w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Carpenter-Ants-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Carpenter-Ants-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\"> 2. Carpenter Ants<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">Carpenter ants are larger ants that can cause structural damage by hollowing out wood to create nests. They don\u2019t consume wood like termites but can weaken wooden structures over time. Effective control requires identifying and eliminating their nests.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9fb9211 e-con-full e-transform e-transform e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9fb9211\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:10,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-61c1aef elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"61c1aef\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"674\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/white-footed-black-ant.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-1221\" alt=\"White-footed house ant feeding on a leaf\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/white-footed-black-ant.jpg 1000w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/white-footed-black-ant-300x202.jpg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/white-footed-black-ant-768x518.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">3. White-Footed House Ants<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">These ants are tiny, dark brown to black, with distinct pale-colored feet. They are common household pests that invade kitchens and pantries, attracted to sugary foods. Their ability to establish large colonies makes professional extermination essential.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b744193 e-con-full e-transform e-transform e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b744193\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:10,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6ebb5d2 elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"6ebb5d2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"333\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Pharaohant.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-1222\" alt=\"Coastal Brown Ants\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Pharaohant.jpeg 500w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Pharaohant-300x200.jpeg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">4. Coastal Brown Ants<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">Coastal brown ants, also known as big-headed ants, are commonly found in outdoor areas but can invade homes. They build nests in soil, walls, and pavements, often forming extensive colonies that are difficult to manage without expert intervention.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-2956c52 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"2956c52\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f5e4d41\" data-id=\"f5e4d41\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-1cc40f8 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"1cc40f8\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-231dc39\" data-id=\"231dc39\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cee4cbe elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"cee4cbe\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">why ants coming<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6d22bd0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6d22bd0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why Are Ants Coming Inside?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-59fd6df custom-list elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"59fd6df\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol><li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Food Sources<\/b>\u00a0\u2013 Crumbs, spills, and uncovered food attract ants. They are particularly drawn to sugary and greasy substances.<\/li><li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Water Availability<\/b>\u00a0\u2013 Leaky pipes, pet water bowls, and damp areas provide the moisture ants need to survive.<\/li><li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Weather Changes<\/b>\u00a0\u2013 Heavy rain, drought, or extreme temperatures can drive ants indoors for a more stable environment.<\/li><li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Scent Trails<\/b>\u00a0\u2013 Ants leave pheromone trails to guide others to food sources, leading to an increasing infestation.<\/li><li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Cracks and Gaps<\/b>\u00a0\u2013 Small openings in doors, windows, and walls allow ants easy access to your home.<\/li><\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2e1c8d0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2e1c8d0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTo prevent ants, keep your home clean, store food properly, fix leaks, and seal entry points. If the infestation persists, professional pest control services can help eliminate the problem effectively.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-60d1b76\" data-id=\"60d1b76\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-406e473 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"406e473\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"421\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Kiwicare_ProblemPageHero_DarwinAnts-1024x539.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-9903\" alt=\"Ant control\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Kiwicare_ProblemPageHero_DarwinAnts-1024x539.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Kiwicare_ProblemPageHero_DarwinAnts-300x158.jpg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Kiwicare_ProblemPageHero_DarwinAnts-768x404.jpg 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Kiwicare_ProblemPageHero_DarwinAnts-1536x809.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Kiwicare_ProblemPageHero_DarwinAnts-2048x1078.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-235b366 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"235b366\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e9ef9af e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e9ef9af\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-101ca7a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"101ca7a\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a4b15cb e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a4b15cb\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c204f1d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c204f1d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">problems<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5de8f7d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5de8f7d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What Problems Can Ants Cause?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e8edb2b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e8edb2b\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ea758e9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ea758e9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Ants may seem harmless, but an infestation can lead to several problems in homes and businesses. Here are some common issues caused by ants:<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1601a40 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"1601a40\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2f4d739 e-con-full elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2f4d739\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f28a7c6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f28a7c6\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-038b414 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-icon-box\" data-id=\"038b414\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >        <!-- link opening -->\n                <!-- end link opening -->\n\n        <div class=\"elementskit-infobox text-left text- icon-lef-right-aligin elementor-animation-   \">\n                        <div class=\"box-body\">\n                        \t\t  \t<p><br><br><br>Ants invade kitchens and pantries, contaminating food by carrying bacteria from unsanitary places. This can pose health risks and lead to food wastage.<\/p>\n                                        <div class=\"box-footer disable_hover_button\">\n                    <div class=\"btn-wraper\">\n                                                            <a class=\"elementskit-btn whitespace--normal elementor-animation-bounce-in\" href=\"#\">\n                                                                            <\/a>\n                                                        <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n        \n        \n                    <div class=\"ekit-icon-box-badge ekit_position_custom\">\n                <span class=\"ekit-badge\"> 1. Food Contamination<\/span>\n            <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n        <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8d7d400 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8d7d400\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-183a18e ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-icon-box\" data-id=\"183a18e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >        <!-- link opening -->\n                <!-- end link opening -->\n\n        <div class=\"elementskit-infobox text-left text- icon-lef-right-aligin elementor-animation-   \">\n                        <div class=\"box-body\">\n                        \t\t  \t<p><br><br><br>Certain ant species, like carpenter ants, burrow into wood to create nests, weakening furniture, wooden structures, and even building foundations over time.<\/p>\n                                        <div class=\"box-footer disable_hover_button\">\n                    <div class=\"btn-wraper\">\n                                                            <a class=\"elementskit-btn whitespace--normal elementor-animation-bounce-in\" href=\"#\">\n                                                                            <\/a>\n                                                        <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n        \n        \n                    <div class=\"ekit-icon-box-badge ekit_position_custom\">\n                <span class=\"ekit-badge\">2. Structural Damage<\/span>\n            <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n        <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-93d7870 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"93d7870\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9f176a0 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-icon-box\" data-id=\"9f176a0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >        <!-- link opening -->\n                <!-- end link opening -->\n\n        <div class=\"elementskit-infobox text-left text- icon-lef-right-aligin elementor-animation-   \">\n                        <div class=\"box-body\">\n                        \t\t  \t<p><br><br><br>Some ants, such as fire ants, deliver painful bites and stings that can cause allergic reactions, itching, and discomfort, especially for children and pets.<\/p>\n                                        <div class=\"box-footer disable_hover_button\">\n                    <div class=\"btn-wraper\">\n                                                            <a class=\"elementskit-btn whitespace--normal elementor-animation-bounce-in\" href=\"#\">\n                                                                            <\/a>\n                                                        <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n        \n        \n                    <div class=\"ekit-icon-box-badge ekit_position_custom\">\n                <span class=\"ekit-badge\"> 3. Painful Bites and Stings<\/span>\n            <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n        <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b6fe9d0 e-con-full elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b6fe9d0\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b46a195 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b46a195\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ee2eedd ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-icon-box\" data-id=\"ee2eedd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >        <!-- link opening -->\n                <!-- end link opening -->\n\n        <div class=\"elementskit-infobox text-left text- icon-lef-right-aligin elementor-animation-   \">\n                        <div class=\"box-body\">\n                        \t\t  \t<p><br><br><br>Ants are attracted to electrical wiring and appliances, leading to short circuits, equipment failure, and potential fire hazards when they chew on wires.<\/p>\n                                        <div class=\"box-footer disable_hover_button\">\n                    <div class=\"btn-wraper\">\n                                                            <a class=\"elementskit-btn whitespace--normal elementor-animation-bounce-in\" href=\"#\">\n                                                                            <\/a>\n                                                        <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n        \n        \n                    <div class=\"ekit-icon-box-badge ekit_position_custom\">\n                <span class=\"ekit-badge\">4. Electrical Damage<\/span>\n            <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n        <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a8f5a1e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a8f5a1e\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d90b953 ekit-equal-height-disable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-icon-box\" data-id=\"d90b953\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >        <!-- link opening -->\n                <!-- end link opening -->\n\n        <div class=\"elementskit-infobox text-left text- icon-lef-right-aligin elementor-animation-   \">\n                        <div class=\"box-body\">\n                        \t\t  \t<p><br><br><br>Ant colonies grow quickly, and once they establish a nest, they can spread to different parts of your property, making eradication difficult without professional pest control.<\/p>\n                                        <div class=\"box-footer disable_hover_button\">\n                    <div class=\"btn-wraper\">\n                                                            <a class=\"elementskit-btn whitespace--normal elementor-animation-bounce-in\" href=\"#\">\n                                                                            <\/a>\n                                                        <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n        \n        \n                    <div class=\"ekit-icon-box-badge ekit_position_custom\">\n                <span class=\"ekit-badge\"> 5. Rapid Infestation Growth<\/span>\n            <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n        <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4299786 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4299786\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5628a19 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-icon-box\" data-id=\"5628a19\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >        <!-- link opening -->\n                <!-- end link opening -->\n\n        <div class=\"elementskit-infobox text-left text- icon-lef-right-aligin elementor-animation-   \">\n                        <div class=\"box-body\">\n                        \t\t  \t<p><br><br><br>For businesses, especially in the food industry, an ant infestation can damage reputation, lead to health code violations, and even cause financial losses..<\/p>\n                                        <div class=\"box-footer disable_hover_button\">\n                    <div class=\"btn-wraper\">\n                                                            <a class=\"elementskit-btn whitespace--normal elementor-animation-bounce-in\" href=\"#\">\n                                                                            <\/a>\n                                                        <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n        \n        \n                    <div class=\"ekit-icon-box-badge ekit_position_custom\">\n                <span class=\"ekit-badge\">6. Business Disruptions<\/span>\n            <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n        <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-782d287 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"782d287\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f76bb2b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f76bb2b\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-87d1dc1 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"87d1dc1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center  hover-border-bottom\" >\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/pathogen-testing-1-r89w6c9nulmfifm63nxly395cvret1xe6eme8imbs0.png\" title=\"pathogen-testing (1)\" alt=\"pathogen-testing (1)\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner\">\n                                                <h3 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n\n                        Food Contamination\n                        \n                    <\/h3>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        Ants invade kitchens and pantries, contaminating food by carrying bacteria from unsanitary places. This can pose health risks and lead to food wastage.                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-987723d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"987723d\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a38fed7 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"a38fed7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center hover_from_right hover-border-bottom\" >\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/failure-r89w6pfeia4g0z31ytmdwzxlo9yjstdmw7r6ye2tcw.png\" title=\"failure\" alt=\"failure\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner\">\n                                                <h3 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n\n                        Structural Damage\n                        \n                    <\/h3>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        Certain ant species, like carpenter ants, burrow into wood to create nests, weakening furniture, wooden structures, and even building foundations over time.                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d83ed9c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d83ed9c\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9e6391c ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"9e6391c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center hover_from_right hover-border-bottom\" >\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/pain-1-r89wostk2gw5iqsvb56uexk1carwz27mdruoj58zkw.png\" title=\"pain (1)\" alt=\"pain (1)\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner\">\n                                                <h3 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n\n                        Painful Bites and Stings\n                        \n                    <\/h3>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        Some ants, such as fire ants, deliver painful bites and stings that can cause allergic reactions, itching, and discomfort, especially for children and pets.                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-56e8a94 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"56e8a94\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6ff100a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6ff100a\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-986a3d4 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"986a3d4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center  hover-border-bottom\" >\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/electricity-r89wrvqigx3zkqbrbh4tl5kffrl87cfy50tz5soj6o.png\" title=\"electricity\" alt=\"electricity\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner\">\n                                                <h3 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n\n                        Electrical Damage\n                        \n                    <\/h3>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        Ants are attracted to electrical wiring and appliances, leading to short circuits, equipment failure, and potential fire hazards when they chew on wires.                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3ff0379 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3ff0379\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9c94e27 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"9c94e27\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center hover_from_right hover-border-bottom\" >\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/mouse-r89wvydc32opvwerj8ime4kc3vihk4m2p6lq0yn480.png\" title=\"mouse\" alt=\"mouse\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner\">\n                                                <h3 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n\n                        Rapid Infestation Growth\n                        \n                    <\/h3>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        Ant colonies grow quickly, and once they establish a nest, they can spread to different parts of your property, making eradication difficult without professional pest control.                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b6100e2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b6100e2\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-afefc50 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"afefc50\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center hover_from_right hover-border-bottom\" >\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/disruption-r89wzvd4k81q9epynxgns4zh7o7jmq5t8kgk0gu2ao.png\" title=\"disruption\" alt=\"disruption\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner\">\n                                                <h3 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n\n                        Business Disruptions\n                        \n                    <\/h3>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        For businesses, especially in the food industry, an ant infestation can damage reputation, lead to health code violations, and even cause financial losses..                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-12c387c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"12c387c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3cbc09e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3cbc09e\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-452e0a4 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"452e0a4\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e47cc08 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e47cc08\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">7. Control Moisture and Leaks<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-23a7e29 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"23a7e29\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Ants are attracted to water sources, so eliminating moisture can help deter them.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-acb9541 elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list\" data-id=\"acb9541\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-list.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"elementor-icon-list-items\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check-double\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M505 174.8l-39.6-39.6c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L192 374.7 80.6 263.2c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L7 302.9c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 34L175 505c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l296-296.2c9.4-9.5 9.4-24.7.1-34zm-324.3 106c6.2 6.3 16.4 6.3 22.6 0l208-208.2c6.2-6.3 6.2-16.4 0-22.6L366.1 4.7c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L192 156.2l-55.4-55.5c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L68.7 146c-6.2 6.3-6.2 16.4 0 22.6l112 112.2z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Fix leaky faucets, pipes, and drains to prevent excess moisture.<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check-double\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M505 174.8l-39.6-39.6c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L192 374.7 80.6 263.2c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L7 302.9c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 34L175 505c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l296-296.2c9.4-9.5 9.4-24.7.1-34zm-324.3 106c6.2 6.3 16.4 6.3 22.6 0l208-208.2c6.2-6.3 6.2-16.4 0-22.6L366.1 4.7c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L192 156.2l-55.4-55.5c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L68.7 146c-6.2 6.3-6.2 16.4 0 22.6l112 112.2z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Use a dehumidifier in damp areas like basements and bathrooms.<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check-double\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M505 174.8l-39.6-39.6c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L192 374.7 80.6 263.2c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L7 302.9c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 34L175 505c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l296-296.2c9.4-9.5 9.4-24.7.1-34zm-324.3 106c6.2 6.3 16.4 6.3 22.6 0l208-208.2c6.2-6.3 6.2-16.4 0-22.6L366.1 4.7c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L192 156.2l-55.4-55.5c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L68.7 146c-6.2 6.3-6.2 16.4 0 22.6l112 112.2z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Ensure proper ventilation to reduce humidity levels.<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6ffb5b4 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6ffb5b4\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d5d1b1b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d5d1b1b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">8. Hire Professional Pest Control Services<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b50781c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b50781c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>If ant infestations persist despite your efforts, professional pest control can provide long-term solutions. Experts can identify the source of the problem and apply treatments that prevent future infestations.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f5c5111 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f5c5111\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d1d5604 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d1d5604\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e0495b8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e0495b8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">4. Use Natural Ant Deterrents<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cb3d33f elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list\" data-id=\"cb3d33f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-list.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"elementor-icon-list-items\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check-double\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M505 174.8l-39.6-39.6c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L192 374.7 80.6 263.2c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L7 302.9c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 34L175 505c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l296-296.2c9.4-9.5 9.4-24.7.1-34zm-324.3 106c6.2 6.3 16.4 6.3 22.6 0l208-208.2c6.2-6.3 6.2-16.4 0-22.6L366.1 4.7c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L192 156.2l-55.4-55.5c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L68.7 146c-6.2 6.3-6.2 16.4 0 22.6l112 112.2z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Sprinkle cinnamon, vinegar, or coffee grounds near ant entry points.<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check-double\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M505 174.8l-39.6-39.6c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L192 374.7 80.6 263.2c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L7 302.9c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 34L175 505c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l296-296.2c9.4-9.5 9.4-24.7.1-34zm-324.3 106c6.2 6.3 16.4 6.3 22.6 0l208-208.2c6.2-6.3 6.2-16.4 0-22.6L366.1 4.7c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L192 156.2l-55.4-55.5c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L68.7 146c-6.2 6.3-6.2 16.4 0 22.6l112 112.2z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Place lemon or orange peels around the kitchen and pantry.<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check-double\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M505 174.8l-39.6-39.6c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L192 374.7 80.6 263.2c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L7 302.9c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 34L175 505c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l296-296.2c9.4-9.5 9.4-24.7.1-34zm-324.3 106c6.2 6.3 16.4 6.3 22.6 0l208-208.2c6.2-6.3 6.2-16.4 0-22.6L366.1 4.7c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L192 156.2l-55.4-55.5c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L68.7 146c-6.2 6.3-6.2 16.4 0 22.6l112 112.2z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Use essential oils like peppermint and tea tree oil to repel ants.<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-594c8ee e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"594c8ee\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-79db49d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"79db49d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">5. Keep Your Outdoor Area Clean<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a55e290 elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list\" dat